204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (This study builds an end-to-end Big DataAnalyticspipeline on Kaggriculture farming-simulation episode replays. Raw nested JSON files are validated, defensively extracted into structured tables, aggregated with a Python MapReduce simulation, explored through visual analyzis, and segmented with K-Means clustering. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (The analyzis covered 675 JSON replay files \(675 valid, 0 malformed\), producing 972,000 turn-player records and 1,350 player-episode records. Among the tested configurations, K = 4 gave the highest silhouette score \(about 0.5246\). The results show how structured processing, MapReduce concepts and unsupervised learning can be combined to analyze complex semi-structured simulation data. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Keywords: Big Data Analytics, MapReduce, Kaggriculture, JSON, Preprocessing, Exploratory Data Analyzis, K-Means Clustering. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
