212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Big Data Analytics is the process of collecting, processing and analyzing large volumes of data to find patterns and trends. Much modern data is semi-structured and must be transformed before it can be analyzed efficiently. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Agricultural simulations are a useful setting for studying resource allocation, production, market prices and economic performance. The Kaggriculture dataset records player actions, farm conditions, crop and livestock activity, market behaviour and rewards. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
