215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (The raw replay data is stored in nested JSON, and information about actions, farm state, prices and rewards is spread across many records. This project develops a pipeline that extracts the relevant fields, converts them into analytical tables, aggregates player performance with MapReduce, identifies activity and market trends, and applies machine learning to group similar player-episode records. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
