372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 155 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates a complete Big Data Analytics workflow on Kaggriculture simulation data. Raw JSON replays were validated and transformed into structured tables, MapReduce aggregated terminal rewards by player, exploratory analyzis described performance, activity, prices and correlations, and K-Means identified four player-episode segments with the best silhouette score \(about 0.5246\) among the tested options. The work also underlines the importance of validation, careful feature preparation, cautious interpretation and transparent reporting of limitations. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
